@startuml activity-diagram
' Local Farm Map V1 — UML Activity Diagram
' Flow: UC-03 Publish Today's Availability (the farmer's <10 s daily update)
' Alternates from SRS UC-03: validation failure, connectivity loss
start
:Open daily update screen
(authenticated farmer with farm profile);
:Today's listings shown as toggles
(pre-checked from existing rows);
while (more products to mark?) is (yes)
  :Toggle product available today
  (eggs / milk / honey / vegetables);
endwhile (no)
:Optionally enter price (KES)
and quantity note;
if (all fields valid?) then (yes)
  :Submit update;
  if (connectivity available?) then (yes)
    :UPSERT listing per product
    UNIQUE (farm, product, listing_date);
    :Set created_at = now
    expires_at = midnight local (Africa/Nairobi);
    :Listings active in discovery
    until expiry unless renewed;
    :Show confirmation;
  else (no)
    :Warn: update NOT confirmed
    retry when back online;
  endif
else (no)
  :Highlight invalid field
  (e.g. negative price);
endif
stop
@enduml
